&P273025 = ARM 02, 118 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-na be-li2-ia qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.ts: ana bēliya qibima 
#tr.en: To my lord speak! 
2. um-ma ba-ah-di-{d}iszkur 
#tr.ts: umma baḫdi-addu 
#tr.en: Thus Baḫdi-Addu, 
3. _ARAD2_-ka-a-ma 
#tr.ts: waradkama 
#tr.en: your servant: 
4. ha-na-_mesz_ wa-ar-ku-um ik-szu-da-am 
#tr.ts: ḫanê warkum ikšudam 
#tr.en: The Hanean rear contingent has arrived; 
5. ha-na-_mesz_ pa-nu-um u3 wa-ar-ku-um sza-lim 
#tr.ts: ḫanê pānum u warkum šalim 
#tr.en: The Hanean lead and rear contingents are well. 
6. u2-ul mu-ur-s,u2-um u2-ul mi-im-ma 
#tr.ts: ul murṣum ul mimma 
#tr.en: No sickness, nothing, 
7. mi-im-ma hi-t,i3-tum u2-ul i-ba-asz-szi 
#tr.ts: mimma hiṭītum ul ibašši 
#tr.en: whatever losses are none, 
8. u3 sza sza-ap-ri-im sza-lim 
#tr.ts: u ša šaprim šalim 
#tr.en: and the expeditionary force is well. 
9. mi-im-ma li-ib-bi be-li2-ia la i-na-a'4-['i2]-id# 
#tr.ts: mimma libbi bēliya la ina’’id 
#tr.en: May the heart of my lord not fear at all. 
10. sza-ni-tam i-na _kaskal-mesz_ ka-li-szi-na# 
#tr.ts: šanītam ina harrānī kalîšina 
#tr.en: Another thing: during all of the expeditions, 
11. uz4-na-am sza-ak-na-ku-ma 
#tr.ts: uznam šaknākuma 
#tr.en: I am all ears, and 
12. ia-ga-a-tum ma-da-a 
#tr.ts: yagâtum mādā 
#tr.en: (there are) many worries. 
13. i-na-an-na i-na _kaskal_ an-ni-tim 
#tr.ts: inanna ina harrānim annītim 
#tr.en: Now, in this expedition 
14. uz4-na-am asz-ku-un-ma 
#tr.ts: uznam aškumma 
#tr.en: I am listening, and 
15. ia-ga-tum u3 mi-im-[ma] 
#tr.ts: yagâtum u mimma 
#tr.en: worries or anything, 
@reverse 
1. u2-ul i-ba-asz-[szi] 
#tr.ts: ul ibašši 
#tr.en: there is none; 
2. s,u2-hu-um-ma me-lu-lu-um-[ma] 
#tr.ts: ṣuhûmma mēlulumma 
#tr.en: there is jesting and playing, 
3. ki-ma i-na _e2_-ta-ti-szu-nu wa-asz-bu 
#tr.ts: kīma ina bītātišunu wašbū 
#tr.en: like staying in their own households, 
4. li-ib-ba-szu-nu t,a3-ab 
#tr.ts: libbašunu ṭāb 
#tr.en: their hearts are sweet; 
5. sza s,i2-ir-mi-im-ma e-pe2-esz 
#tr.ts: ša ṣirmimma epēš 
#tr.en: of the endeavor: doing 
6. ka-ak-ki-i u3 da-ak na-ak-ri-im-ma 
#tr.ts: kakkī u dâk nakrimma 
#tr.en: weapons and killing the enemy, 
7. li-ib-bi _ARAD2-mesz_ be-li2-ia i-da-ab-bu-ub 
#tr.ts: libbī wardī bēliya idabbub 
#tr.en: the heart of the servants of my lord is speaking. 
8. be-li2 lu-u2 ha-di-i 
#tr.ts: bēlī lū ḫadi 
#tr.en: May my lord be happy!
